<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Friday that Fila Holdings was unavailable for after hours trading for news.</p>
<p>The exchange also said that Vivra Inc, Edison Brothers Stores Inc, Buenos Aires Embotelladora and Corimon SACA were unavailable in after hours trading.</p>
</text>
